        {
          "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
          "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
          "row_index": 2,
          "cells": [
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002:c00",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_index": 2,
              "column_index": 0,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "The pump uses too\nmuch power",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 65.784,
                "top": 118.58,
                "x1": 196.13,
                "bottom": 322.73
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002:c01",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_index": 2,
              "column_index": 1,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "1. Counter-pressure too\nlow\n2. The liquid is heavier\nthan water\n3. Foreign body in pump\n4. Electric motor is\nrunning on 2 phases\n5. RPM too high\n6. Pump and electric\nmotor not aligned.",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 196.13,
                "top": 118.58,
                "x1": 349.27,
                "bottom": 322.73
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002:c02",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r002",
              "row_index": 2,
              "column_index": 2,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "Insert orifice plate or check\nvalve/Contact DESMI\nContact DESMI\nDismantle the pump, remove\nthe cause\nCheck fuses, cable\nconnection, and cable\nFit bigger V-belt pulley on\npump. Change RPM of\nelectric motor.\nAlign unit (see para. about\nalignment)",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 349.27,
                "top": 118.58,
                "x1": 512.38,
                "bottom": 322.73
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
          "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
          "row_index": 3,
          "cells": [
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003:c00",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_index": 3,
              "column_index": 0,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "The pump capacity is\nunstable",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 65.784,
                "top": 322.73,
                "x1": 196.13,
                "bottom": 419.95
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003:c01",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_index": 3,
              "column_index": 1,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "1. Suction line leaks\n2. Air pockets in suction\nline\n3. The pump takes air",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 196.13,
                "top": 322.73,
                "x1": 349.27,
                "bottom": 419.95
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003:c02",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r003",
              "row_index": 3,
              "column_index": 2,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "Tighten suction line\nNormally the disappear in a\nshort time\nLiquid reservoir emptied/\nSuction line not sufficiently\nsubmerged",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 349.27,
                "top": 322.73,
                "x1": 512.38,
                "bottom": 419.95
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
          "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
          "row_index": 4,
          "cells": [
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004:c00",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_index": 4,
              "column_index": 0,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "The pump makes\nnoise",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 65.784,
                "top": 419.95,
                "x1": 196.13,
                "bottom": 538.39
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004:c01",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_index": 4,
              "column_index": 1,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "1. Cavitation in pump\n2. Incorrect alignment\n3. Defective bearings",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 196.13,
                "top": 419.95,
                "x1": 349.27,
                "bottom": 538.39
              }
            },
            {
              "cell_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004:c02",
              "table_id": "MP004:p0012:t00",
              "row_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_group_id": "MP004:p0012:t00:r004",
              "row_index": 4,
              "column_index": 2,
              "column_name": "",
              "column_role": "unclassified",
              "text": "Suction lift too high/ Suction\nline wrongly\ndimensioned/Liquid\ntemperature too high.\nAlign the pump and motor\n(see para. about alignment)\nReplace bearings",
              "page_text_start": null,
              "page_text_end": null,
              "page_text_source": null,
              "bbox": {
                "x0": 349.27,
                "top": 419.95,
                "x1": 512.38,
                "bottom": 538.39
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
